{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1271,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92256c2ab1ed67cd2dcffcf1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Let's muscle！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdbdaf8691b461350dd6d9f21b0d23c172260ff3fc77e89fe83e1c1d2b4f5a30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8e15ca17bbc9f38a4f4df16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不会输的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "70cf5af384b541c95e8c097e3524903e779ce3bb87c95addd7d74ba0114e8ffa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f4f31420d369a655531b4a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "算是我……用自己的方式在挑战吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5daa933391d772fe927cef5d370173aba2457d2c50a71dd108d3c4d496c25af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:366ee40e37bc956618fcab6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果轻飘飘的程度，\r\n和这件长版上衣差不多的话……嗯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "78d2282b4b20c109a7226f67b175b288b03472d946acdd010a60fb3084407bdf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac8dbfddf5bf20649a540f2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然可能不太适合我就是了……\r\n啊哈哈！",
      "source_fingerprint": "86175c667365f0882e7212b18d6d2204c677852be9d52e4199a85da44e599a3c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e39f0e965f35652501ace94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这……会不会有点太可爱了啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "478cc369197e3db7dbb37e5a325bcb7604799ec4784023fe54b6ac7eb6fb82d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed6c920b3ea58c926e11046d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "干劲、勇气、肌肉，全都很充足！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3474c11ecb7eabe5e0aa59a79d11030f57834d938ca05a491a5f3e4eac4c189",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:144e1bd12a4f5704d389f51b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个……这裙子会不会有点太短了？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b8ddbbff6b04565a51fd0ac31aa8eaed52e69db944c898934d6fc4d1cbec1ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22983d87cbc4b65afac2e6ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "也要习惯穿这样的衣服才行呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "41f81d07bc5c4381b377d70ccbc1de7324dd0e016eb2f32ce5e909a241549eeb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2211bb8292a0964804cb2471",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个衣服……很适合肌肉耶！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68df428987f60d17c46141b24c6fcb36afd24f43a6968cc19a5071dbf792332",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca564eae8a3e4ce059413458",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会潇洒地帮助你鼓起勇气的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffcdc7d29fcc3fb7a662de5ee4084c79533aabbcb947c71ed170259352bb33d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bbdbc956ba50ec1ef0e9674",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怀表，是能制作美味饮品的专家\r\n所拥有的证明。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2ebdbd6a2a0eef876da063b3733c15c3b0c2348c6c28d4a12f7d0db3c146e3e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b97ca8377d0af02a27a6473",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Let's muscle！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdbdaf8691b461350dd6d9f21b0d23c172260ff3fc77e89fe83e1c1d2b4f5a30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0d7717be5c7a475202470ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不会输的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "70cf5af384b541c95e8c097e3524903e779ce3bb87c95addd7d74ba0114e8ffa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eab13ee81865a3b1dc1a2a46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2a2f2dd22d880d9e216d4d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也是目白家的赛马娘！\r\n我要拿下这场比赛的胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dfccb0fe3cf80bd498eb0754eb17ccca0d606f6da7ff328b6c760d2a050237f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27b64f7c2d1d6352745c43d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉肌肉的热身已经做得差不多了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "16b3e20a37e11dd186b186ed35d248386adb713d64536d0c3cb3d7a9bddfaae2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29521dae653622e0c9fea332",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安！今天也是个舒服的早晨呢。\r\n在上课之前我先去跑一趟好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "81fc68eb31da29f23a2d3f4d038534dcfdff18fc8356ccef8ea726a9baa1adcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77d4b571fe9d588252a998f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "维他命、矿物质、蛋白质，\r\n一早就都补充完毕了。\r\n为的是能够一直努力到晚上！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48f1e73ca87e31bccb9c9d29e6c4a5ef8cf341751a9c7d84f3cfa515e47efdff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd316e6945de00888c87acb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午安！今天我们要做什么训练啊？\r\n是重训还是耐力跑！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "21e8f8528ab77a5def7fde5ddb6d1f24dc3e90f4022a4138ad3191ecea811fed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33d09e027e19f2e14c735d58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，要不要跟我一起补充蛋白质？\r\n最近的产品味道越来越讲究了，\r\n很容易上瘾哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "822cdbdcb0518e1ec4ac25e05e5df06d8dcadac61019e5b46bc633d8d8c9121e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25b21706732b2d47cc83bb6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚上一定要好好地睡觉哦。\r\n睡眠不足是会导致集中力\r\n跟新陈代谢急遽下降的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "995daa4e574f387451b8bc5553aea427ec6c51935ae6723ba8bde6d088e1491f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6885ba7551714b33ceaeca7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天要做什么好呢……\r\n想要锻炼腹肌，\r\n又想要锻炼竖脊肌……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c41763fd106ece3eb4bd126f5d7560e1e5de5cd3d0c5361df058b0584e42502e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc6648afda84b7e75f0a135c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "充满春天气息的洋装真好看……\r\n麦昆跟多伯穿起来\r\n一定很适合的吧……嗯～",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c81ec0485c26c9d81d83a529c05811fb01012370bc6d8857903e508b13a9114",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60126e00c5458cad1447bf95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "炎热的夏天就一定要待在健身房！\r\n完全不用烦恼温度跟湿度的问题，\r\n可以100％全力投入训练！",
      "source_fingerprint": "24762dd7e0784d0ec10205c8691dffb67952a0e7c81db89be17288fb4b4d649d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13fc024fea0a65cc7724beb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要赏红叶的话，我推荐去山里看哦！\r\n顺便还可以做高地训练，\r\n好好提升我的心肺功能！",
      "source_fingerprint": "124c1507fe033533c0160f1cd01a36b5d52517ad62702918e618a76a8c32038c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46ddd6cd9730ef08f39c64a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冷的时候就更该做运动来温暖身心！\r\n我们一起来锻炼肌肉吧！\r\nLet's muscle！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdb5a971caf12870438cdbe93d29963899af3e88cf3d5a890aa21effc7e4a51b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2d9b9d7db707535d1f33a24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安！\r\n为了开始充满活力的一天，\r\n请享用这根乳清蛋白巧克力棒吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7757c00a31e6f3330cc0b74a2a01a596ed949823873161adc6a7c0c42b219700",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e4a64d1a5b4939172034a01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喝杯咖啡醒醒脑如何？\r\n我来泡杯让人一大早就能\r\n做完十组卧推的能量咖啡吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "05e4355d79b5a4a30819ad3267e6114d0ce6a3f2a0880d8953c3f9d0b103a42f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8622802b86fd88ae019afc45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午餐时间来一客鸡胸肉色拉\r\n怎么样？……啊，没有啦，\r\n我在模仿漫画上看到的店长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c81cd9d5db78b1dce29545d75f10add350a689bf465abb2c5c01dfa049723b13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0344766d10ed45141867ac49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午餐后来杯热腾腾的咖啡如何？\r\n嘿嘿，其实咖啡因\r\n对重训也有帮助喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5df466706856b653f45089c55ca88c88f800d28e6e80b0fac3cab88b88759ce3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84484e038f7b0bb23d5ee273",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我来泡杯加了\r\n乳清蛋白的热牛奶给你吧。\r\n我每天晚上都会喝一杯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2ff5de695b5483dc03ceabe13606b45d504c38dc3ef5ffd88af4e1238cdd201",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc80e039034a8fe517dcbdb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我看生生正忙着做事，便悄悄地\r\n为她递上了一杯咖啡……连我自己\r\n都觉得这举动真帅气呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5aaec5bfbd830a3f9bb34333f3284549dd898d3afdd2665a552525b2460bcd2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f53a0966fa85ba0341e3f30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天是心念一转的季节！\r\n今年我一定要成为能够潇洒地\r\n辅助他人的成熟赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bb205984620823df00abec34ddc0d49ee90d9f4f5c603b85cada7f4d3654148",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b567253ebf4087c6283cb0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气太热没食欲时，要不要喝杯\r\n蜂蜜柠檬麦茶呢？打起精神，\r\n一起培养强健的体格吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3525088434d05c76b7fef2306887f6b685d9a0771ad3a9bffaf8fb1987726763",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:192f86abd50531b44d5a068e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "运动之秋也是读书之秋！所以呢，\r\n我打算挑战边骑室内脚踏车\r\n边读完一整本文库本！",
      "source_fingerprint": "325ee2e21f53052cc971f370713e01d16598a4c932fd777acbcbdf9aad0dec3c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e062f60d6eda35d8ae12591",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喝杯暖～暖的热可可能让全身\r\n由内到外暖和起来喔。不然的话\r\n只有重训可以达到相同效果了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bab6e0c53eafbf27f996eab3aaa83fea7b3bef051b2d19294077d642730ada66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:679cd013a4f6ffce2fa86a06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cefc57db35c3e5579010b44e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:233a40005485aba875efc925",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每次见到麦昆都会感受到她的成长，\r\n有种虽然在我身边却离我很\r\n遥远的感觉……也许是我多想了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bf1874a50bb2712822c18fe8e4045855168d7ba1975d2aeb7212e07f6de656c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81ba2170706c8ac860e19e49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "艾尼推荐的衣服真的机动性很高哦！\r\n嘿嘿，帮她挑一双运动鞋当回礼好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0f330532ac76d6c7df18c7a099e5e953a0bfedccaf0cad0535b42c8d7b185da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ca2f6fb4e390571a6c06178",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很喜欢短发哦。\r\n不只好活动，洗头也很轻松。\r\n外观上我也觉得这样最适合自己！",
      "source_fingerprint": "91d687de97f6b02b0eb60caa8a8fe6f8dd74651e0e14bc38c891fb6b704f056d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fd2b8a920b4a95d98e5064c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多伯虽然看起来态度很冷淡，\r\n但她只是比较不擅长表达而已。\r\n其实她有很多可爱的地方呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "776efb52c768fc91ab0dea07ff89a81d6f007f9b6166da2561a8793784146592",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50c8824cf0c7419327cc7001",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "运动项目里我最喜欢的是棒球。\r\n以前常常约麦昆和多伯一起看球赛呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1825dd867b340c99cf748a1c0ab0f6c812b7c5d3f3f82353d6d70b96df9cb317",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23f47f0ff15c7700787004c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果有觉得奇怪的地方，\r\n不要客气，请直接跟我说哦……！\r\n毕竟我不习惯穿这样的衣服……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f85709f760473b83c1e88b34c3e79b1194783a0c99c4a1a97e0c1cf7a704139",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95538140e12cd6ce72053adf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没问题、没问题……！\r\n里面是短裤嘛，\r\n就当作跟平常一样就好……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97ef5a5608caab28cbb31f40b9c888168e021d3144aecab953ee022c178da0af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99dd30186224b49f29778f7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是只属于我的决胜服……！\r\n为了不辜负大家对我的期望，\r\n我要更加努力才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c439b3cd93a45ef99a781ce6af23fe234175f9bd00f499428ff17a83f6924e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9f230729cc6352d2e1d7ca2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为很好活动，\r\n感觉可以立刻来打一场棒球！\r\n目标是夺三振哦～开玩笑的啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a858575829963bf348efa227fc9e0be50c3d4090a578596cdf843d09d767fdc8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb33ecd9ac19f1782527a58a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "特雷森学园的制服很可爱吧……\r\n虽然每天早上都穿着出门，但我还是\r\n不确定是否适合自己……啊、啊哈哈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "227725f0082b5b43e94cc635152067ce1d2d662214f1b0bf343779fc43362c64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a78476b133fa8bf16313128a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小栗帽吃那么多，\r\n她是不是都在做很激烈的训练啊？\r\n我也要向她看齐才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d1b08eee2897432ba2b20030fb912ff913c7f7f921672ac551afbb8f8965fd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6922be70f5702ae057a49261",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个漫画接下来会有\r\n什么样令人期待的进展啊……！？\r\n唔唔～我要回去继续看了～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cb0acc3bc471fcf5c8104f890a318141675fb21a0eb8e137c61ba28dd26ac5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34845450291f21137b9bd1fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「开学当天叼着胡萝卜\r\n撞上命中注定的人！」什么的……\r\n现实中从来没看过呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7db8dce1fe93f625f9243618b8e3ecccb76974f67a128f95dd637a002ba1ccdd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3250793c6f892dae0a557482",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天可能会下雨。\r\n状况不好的赛道我也很喜欢哦。\r\n跑起来的感觉特别强烈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c4eb8a7ac043b455c48ebd34e00eaf65a69534d9737a8065e14cf02ebc4f03f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c6ad39172c4037f6b31984c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天的水果营养成份很高，\r\n所以很适合用来补充能量。\r\n有种营养在肌肉间流窜的感觉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b6b45caa6ce219c217c880771d484866a2daf6c24dad434cad8ccaa71368241",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7e16e9a5a044f87cab1e8e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「很冷吧？……把手给我。」\r\n唔～！这个台词真的很帅耶～～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a6fecf073344fa32d4a2083a66af8afe8277669b175f5391003edc1321f8d09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ace8d39dfc28b0dd4cf060d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上次我跟小涡玩鬼抓人，\r\n她从头到尾都火力全开地抓人，\r\n被追的我也觉得超惊险刺激的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "19ce25ca0225d707697a2a399d0ae750d3909284ca1b8f9694b3867a2a7c0552",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3efac2125630dbbe978d09d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小美的口头禅「Marvelous☆」\r\n好像满适合用来当作\r\n健美的喊声呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "56929cfe864de8bf52302f0ac3daf36f57620fe0acf876f867e6805f7e3b7284",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4704f21dd7faebb22da58ec6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想象看看阿尔丹这样的女孩，\r\n坐在树叶间阳光洒落的咖啡厅……\r\n根本就是女主角……真令人向往。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c567b7d4b64597d1ffaf486088fec25b6dec837ac3abfbd92b699983a28c4b2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a024d133f6b01c8dc725181",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我跟小曙一起重训，她竟然误把杠铃\r\n当成哑铃，用单手就举起来了……\r\n我可不能输给她！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f95d3c48dccc9448f05fca40969f79bdcb7342a4617284b8d95d382032c6533",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b4acabb66b1c918592b7c45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每次我在镜子前摆姿势确认肌肉时，\r\n小微都会以为是在摆变身动作，\r\n跑到我旁边来。真可爱～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e1b742c2d3a51ca7bdd845d56ebe4dd7dfa7ac5e80bcbc14ab165d10d2189a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e5d56f8e0eb98b3ee07c140",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我跟光明一起去慢跑，\r\n却变得像在悠闲地散步一样……\r\n不过我们还是有跑完全程喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8345d20c667ff74facb54576ba0548c09e98a61f3321d6c460018f00e60a5109",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fad02fa3c9a5aba9f0edbdae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有什么既适合这套服装，\r\n又可以吃得优雅的料理呢……？\r\n鸡胸肉三明治或许不错？",
      "source_fingerprint": "08438c28a2cfbf254a3d4fce74e96e217c1eee84ccbab92cfe44f62619c683a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:425ac4bbccb0b595467b393d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要想更接近像训练员那样\r\n干练大人的形象的话……\r\n应该先从每天晚上去健身房开始？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2640cd1cb75c490dea04f9e26826e702e7464b843364c5426ad17bfa8050652f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c46362488e48611539537a7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上次我跟善信去了高尔夫练习场。\r\n朝着春季的蓝天全力挥杆……\r\n真是太舒畅了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e4327f65fbd8af9b52b45089c777c212d737535cdd85f49ebd771126c224a9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f19573f1ffa84105bdcb9660",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管再热都不会表现出来，\r\n仍然爽朗地迎接客人……\r\n这正是一流店长的证明吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a952b5378f7e2a62bfeb89d80ecb877f86ebf377029a615649fb64ec32680a7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fbd72959ae422396fa0c7ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想配合新衣服顺便改变一下发型，\r\n所以用修图软件把头发修成长发……\r\n但对我来说似乎还是有点太早了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d332c98f39947cfe80b8815dbb2513f28a17b67f11a9d8c310877f63e3937523",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed161ce1781bb848d3134c5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "边眺望着窗外的雪，边为\r\n躲进店里取暖的情侣端上咖啡……\r\n这种情景也不错呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8027a0919506a697351ad3d878afb72324703e6a1db15e3b18c871508934e33c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd1ab72e30a23afce44df492",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即便在比赛上，我也想要\r\n为观众带来能够激励人心的表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "edc28ec2dca627999e28e3db582b2fcb59b43a5b7c612a1d415a5b24cf66a8d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79c310c9656098bb7b49d8d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着这身衣服，\r\n光是走起路来就觉得自己好潇洒。\r\n感觉有点像真的变身了一样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6256c8a3dee347b2e900915e2a7eafe3a48fc1e4bf04b28d873e0273b4257582",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24b45f279bd646f893299851",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "未来的自己取决于平时的努力！\r\n今天也要好好锻炼哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48ea71b7c714712fb26e9186150486ca595437959a999760305c32dc3d3e87e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2b324cdd746a4025ecf1567",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "頑張るぞーっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "90a28870554c83424f396c8622ca63c1145245bdce94bc6d075587971b9541db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3597eb549a907ac0b9baae9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯！背阔肌跟\r\n肱三头肌都感觉不错哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7231fc3a2597d64bf29abb01751027988fea705d13f1d12e375cf2a96d2e6eb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55e5c8755a0d04ddee61982b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跑步最需要的东西是什么……\r\n答案就是「肌肉」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba07a2966f31f9dc2a9153561d96bbfa91d363d9406d7756fa33850e0bf9d9db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a41dc77b75a1772d7f7cbc6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那我们开始训练吧。\r\n不赶快活动活动的话，\r\n肌肉是会退化的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "59b01409d84cf6092ccde4301e1ff3e9287732624f55f583cc54cfc40cde8c68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:208d83d9d35b37259b428cba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "肌肉是不会背叛自己的！\r\n只要持续地进行训练，\r\n我相信它一定会变得更强健！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d47e159f713199e9534b506e4f119018d21d637f79ab80f785bad04e839782bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e00c44002030f380035f399",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "会想要比任何人都强，\r\n是因为我想要赢……\r\n这份心情，我不会再忘记了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e62f01c8107ebd204dd8cbd4edbed39b27ae4a42a4cd13db4077720e890e4dd2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fddc0e87708f73177f3d452",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想要让大家都看到，\r\n因为有训练员的帮忙，\r\n让我「成为了最强的赛马娘」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9799ac2d071791cfbee8a1c85324ce616aa5e65f84cf18a93ad977f615948d23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80d88634d7080876a55f11a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要不放弃就一定能成功！\r\n没错，只要肯努力，\r\n谁都能练出倒三角形的身材！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f2c3a59f902fe2cff372337dd10af84831c3dc577c6eb157327ae881d9b2f8c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8bf4c386423aaa68587deb6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "光是翻转巨大的轮胎，\r\n就是种有效的训练。学园里的\r\n特大轮胎……我翻得动吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd6e1e28826d7ff331a19e3c3ae3f69fb7b27eb5f8a2c7854a9688c6a31ed0ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:435bd46678c58aecb3bb82f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么……就潇洒而优雅，\r\n并且充满活力地开始吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b42c33fc39d906a0e902f29c6332cb589b6d9586466981e32ccd025338fc94d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "92016"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
